{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act53side_level_act53side_01_beg","storyGroup":"act53side","storySort":2,"storyDependence":"act53side_level_act53side_st01","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TO-1","storyName":"收信地：终点","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"大断连让现在才送到的解密器毫无用处，安洁莉娜因而决定自行前往南境拿回数据。从未离开过大涌泉镇的塔妮希望跟安洁莉娜一起去南境。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act53side/level_act53side_01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act53side_01","minState":"UNLOCKED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["奇怪的年轻人A","安洁莉娜","奇怪的年轻人B","？？？","塔妮","不再奇怪的年轻人们","皮塔","皮塔&塔妮"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_bg_76_g4_dailytown.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$relax_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_relax_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的年轻人A","text":"嚯嚯，面生的小沃尔珀，第一次见你，新来送药的？","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"呃，应该是......吧？","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-22$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的年轻人A","text":"你说话怎么犹犹豫豫的！别小看我们，赶紧把勒柄嘘混拿出来！","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#12$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"勒柄嘘混？","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":20},{"type":"charslot","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的年轻人A","text":"哎呀，辣瓶树粉！我手里这种！看看姐手里这么纯的辣瓶树粉，一口下去天灵盖都爽飞上天！","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1185_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1185_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的年轻人B","text":"嘿，小沃尔珀，你不怎么上道啊。从哪来的？叙拉古？","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1185_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的年轻人B","text":"你们叙拉古有像我们这么厉害的人吗？身上有我们这样吓人的纹身吗？给你看看——我这满背的大牙兽，吓死你！","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1185_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":30},{"type":"charslot","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#11$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"抱歉，我......我想我可能走错地方了！","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#15$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"80,0","duration":"0.6","id":35},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":36},{"type":"charslot","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的年轻人A","text":"欸——等等，刚来就走你是什么意思，我们要的东西还没给呢！","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的年轻人A","text":"没听过我们的名号吗？我们可是头盔姐安珀和路障哥皮塔！","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"呃......不好意思，我真的有急事需要离开——","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":43},{"type":"charslot","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1185_1#1$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的年轻人B","text":"——想走就走，看不起我们是吧！把辣瓶树粉交出来！","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1185_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#17$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"你们......","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"嘿！！","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"欸？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-22$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"charslot","id":54},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#11$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"你......你......","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":59},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stompfeet","volume":"0.8","id":60},{"type":"text","text":"疾跑而来的女孩一口气没顺上来，卡壳之后又不知该从何说起，急得忍不住开始跺脚。","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"虽然气势一下子减弱了一大半，但她还是成功转移了那两个年轻人的注意力。","id":62},{"type":"dialog","id":63},{"type":"charslot","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1185_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的年轻人A","text":"嘿，塔妮，你过来干什么？这里可不是你这种乖孩子来的地——","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":68},{"type":"charslot","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"停！","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"辣瓶树粉根本就不是药！你们每次吸到鼻子里挤眉弄眼又流眼泪的，那根本不是药效，是被辣的！","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":74},{"type":"charslot","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1185_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的年轻人A","text":"胡说！","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1186_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#3$1","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"而且你们现在拿的也不是什么“超级纯的辣瓶树粉”，就是萝卜和辣椒放在一起磨成的粉——研磨机还是求爷爷告奶奶才弄来的二手货！","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":83},{"type":"charslot","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1185_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"shake","power":"5","times":"60","isblock":"true","duration":"0.2","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的年轻人A","text":"......呃！塔妮，这件事——","id":89},{"type":"dialog","id":90},{"type":"charslot","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"镇上所有人都知道！","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"还有你！你身上的也根本不是满背纹身，那是一卡列提能批发五百张的纹身贴！","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":95},{"type":"charslot","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1185_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1186_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"shake","power":"5","times":"60","isblock":"true","duration":"0.2","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的年轻人B","text":"......啊！","id":101},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"all","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"shake","power":"5","times":"60","isblock":"true","duration":"0.2","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"shake","power":"5","times":"60","isblock":"true","duration":"0.2","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不再奇怪的年轻人们","text":"塔妮，给我等着！总有一天你会后悔的！","id":107},{"type":"dialog","id":108},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.4","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.4","id":111},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":112},{"type":"dialog","id":113},{"type":"charslot","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#18$1","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#21$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"1","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"1.1","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"噗，他们怎么回事呀？","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-21$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#18$1","focus":"r","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"......两个标新立异的怪家伙。可能是镇子上太无聊了吧，所以开始学叙拉古电影里的角色，搞得不伦不类的。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$1","focus":"r","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"忘记自我介绍了，我是大涌泉镇的接线员塔妮！","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#14$1","focus":"r","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"很抱歉给你添了麻烦......但这次的问题真的很奇怪，线路接对了，人却是错的，镇上的交换机从来没出现过这种问题......","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"抱歉，我回去一定会检修一下线路的。你——","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"你是一名信使？","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"对呀。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"那、那你是不是去过很多地方？雷姆必拓之外的地方？","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"唔......维多利亚、叙拉古、东国、炎国、莱塔尼亚......确实很多，而且不常来雷姆必拓。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"（小声）这么多地方......哇哦！","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"能不能麻烦你帮我问问罗德岛办事处到底在哪？我有很重要的东西要送过去。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"镇子上的矿石病疗养机构都在大涌泉镇的温泉广场扎堆，每隔一段时间就会换一批。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"你人生地不熟的估计得找好长时间，还是我带你去——","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"呃，我是说，我帮你一起找！","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":145},{"type":"dialog","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":148},{"type":"charslot","id":149},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_bg_76_g3_bathhouse.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":150},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":151},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":153},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tech_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_sys_tech_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":154,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#9$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","focus":"l","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"“泉愈园”“天然热疗馆”“养生水疗”“胜药温泉馆”......","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"呃，罗德岛的办事处应该更正规才对，而且他们还要建一个数据分析站点......","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"但和感染者相关的外来机构都在这里了。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"虽然大涌泉镇不排斥做感染者的生意，但......","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"......嗯，我明白。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"那边那个人，她手里拿着的袋子，上面是不是写着“罗德岛”？","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$2","focus":"l","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"袋子上的字我看不清——","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-22$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":169},{"type":"charslot","id":170},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_088","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":173},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"charslot","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#21$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","focus":"l","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"不对不对，她当然是罗德岛干员！","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-21$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"0.6","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":181},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":182},{"type":"dialog","id":183},{"type":"charslot","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_088","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"80,0","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","posfrom":"-180,0","posto":"50,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"1.1","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"您好，我是安洁莉娜！请问您认识大涌泉镇办事处的皮塔干员吗？我是罗德岛总部来的信使安洁莉娜！","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"r","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"我就是皮塔，你好你好。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"之前是我弄丢了本应寄给您的解密器，导致您没有办法继续研究，真的非常抱歉！","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"r","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"解密器......没有办法继续研究？","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"哦......也对，你还不知道大断连的事啊。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"因为大断连，零号公路沿线的远程通讯都断了，南境的数据根本发送不过来，就算你送来了十个解密器也没用。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"所以“断连”的其实是零号公路沿线的远程通讯？","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"r","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"是啊，更确切地说，是“纵贯红土公司”设立的远程通讯系统。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$2","focus":"l","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"我之前好像也听说过类似的名字，不过纵贯的好像不是红土......","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-22$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"r","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"嗯，这家公司是哥伦比亚特里蒙的，叫“纵贯公司”。他们每设一个国外分公司都会起不同的名字。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"在玻利瓦尔的叫“纵贯树海”，在谢拉格的叫“纵贯险峰”，“纵贯红土”就是雷姆必拓了。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"本来嘛，靠他们从这座大涌泉镇架设到雷姆必拓首都终极大铁屯的线路，一路上的人都是可以远程通讯的。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"罗德岛当初也选择接入了纵贯红土公司的线路，数据可以从南境发送到大铁屯再发过来。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"出于数据保密的要求，超出时限没有处理的数据会自动销毁，等待下一个发送周期。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"但在我向罗德岛总部寄出没有收到解密器的回函之后，零号公路沿线的远程通讯全都断了......唔，应该是六月左右吧。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"六月份......那如果我上次的包裹没有送错，您应该是来得及解密南境的数据的......？","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"r","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"理论上是这样啦——不说这些不高兴的了。你不是还给我带药物了嘛，真是帮了大忙！让我看看——","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"皮塔","text":"矿石病急性发作抑制剂四十支、","id":217},{"type":"multiline","name":"皮塔","text":"源石粉尘防护套装十件、","id":218},{"type":"multiline","name":"皮塔","text":"“啊~致我的爱人~”手工巧克力一盒——","id":219},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_comedy_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":220,"musicid":2},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"欸？我的爱人？","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":222},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"charslot","id":226},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_76_i01_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":227},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":228},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":230},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":234},{"type":"charslot","id":235},{"type":"image","id":236},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#8$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","focus":"l","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_088","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"80,0","focus":"l","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"......是因为来的路上越野车载货区放着的信被风吹散了，打包的时候手忙脚乱，有些包裹的位置就放错了。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#9$2","focus":"l","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"说起这件事，我记得出发的时候检查过，包裹都捆严实了才对......为什么偏偏在那个地方全都飞出去了呢？","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"r","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"这你就不知道啦。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"相传在雷姆必拓的土地上，有一种生物会“偷走”人们没有说出口的话。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#7$2","focus":"l","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"偷走......话语？这怎么可能？","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":249},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"皮塔小姐，您说的是有袋鼷兽的传说？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"有袋鼷兽？","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"嗯。在雷姆必拓，有袋鼷兽的故事是每一个孩子都听过的睡前故事。我奶奶告诉我的版本是这样的......","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_dream","volume":"0.5","id":257},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":259},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.5","fillto":"0.18","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","id":261},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.5","fillto":"0.18","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":263},{"type":"charslot","id":264},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":265},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"1","block":"false","id":266},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"0.2","g":"0.2","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":267},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"1","to":"0.6","block":"false","id":268},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"在雷姆必拓还没有移动平台，没有零号公路，甚至没有信使的时候......","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"荒地上天灾频发，冲散了很多原本住在一起的家人，令他们不得不生活在不同的村庄。","id":271},{"type":"dialog","id":272},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":273,"style":"bg","name":"bg_black","afrom":"1","ato":"0.5","duration":"2","slot":"bgover","layer":"2"},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":274,"style":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_spotlight_02","x":"0","y":"80","slot":"bgover","layer":"1"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spotlight","volume":"0.7","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2356_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,-30","posto":"50,-30","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.45","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":277},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"有一个勇敢的雷姆必拓人，她对人与人之间无法传递心意感到痛心，自发成为第一位信使，为相隔甚远的亲人、朋友、恋人们传递话语。","id":279},{"type":"dialog","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"50,-30","posto":"-250,-30","duration":"0.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2349_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.55","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2349_1#1$1","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"-150,0","duration":"0.5","afrom":"1","ato":"1","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"与她一同上路的，是一只形似鼷兽，还会飞翔的聪慧生物。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_2349_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"因为它的胸前有一个口袋，又总喜欢把自己珍视的东西藏进口袋里，所以叫它有袋鼷兽。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_2349_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"她们的旅程一直非常愉快，直到有一天，有袋鼷兽无论如何不愿再替她送信。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_2349_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"勇敢的雷姆必拓人发现有袋鼷兽偷看了信件，信件变得空白一片，有袋鼷兽把信中的心意和话语全都占为己有。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_2349_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_knock_head","volume":"1","id":291},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2349_1#1$4","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"在有袋鼷兽逃走之前，勇敢的雷姆必拓人用行路的手杖敲打了它的脑袋，让它忘记了听懂和阅读话语的能力。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_2349_1$4.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":295},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bubble_cartoon_1","volume":"1","id":296},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_emoji_proud","layer":"1","x":"90","y":"80","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2349_1#2$1","duration":"0.3","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":299},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":300},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":301},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wing","volume":"1","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2349_1#1$6","duration":"0.3","id":303},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2349_1#1$6","posfrom":"-150,-30","posto":"130,20","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":305},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"130,-20","posto":"300,100","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"有袋鼷兽受伤的地方长出了显眼的绒毛，在偷窃话语时再也无法完全隐匿身形，最后只能躲去南境生活。","id":309},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"charslot","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2356_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,-60","posto":"-80,-60","duration":"1","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2355_1#1$1","posfrom":"300,-60","posto":"180,-60","duration":"1","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2352_1#1$1","posfrom":"280,-63","posto":"160,-63","duration":"1","id":314},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"勇敢的雷姆必拓人将这个故事告诉了她遇到的所有人，提醒他们要把未说出口的话和心意尽快向重要的人表达，以防被有袋鼷兽窃走。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_2352_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"0.2","g":"0.2","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":320},{"type":"curtain","id":321},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_bg_76_g3_bathhouse.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":322},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0.6","to":"0","block":"false","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":324},{"type":"charslot","id":325},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#6$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"唔......塔妮很会讲故事欸，我都能想象到有袋鼷兽的样子了——","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$1","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"是我奶奶讲得好啦——","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#15$1","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"不不不，但这可不只是故事！","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"雷姆必拓的信使都知道，要在包裹上挂好驱赶有袋鼷兽的草药包，我的接线室门口也挂着“禁止有袋鼷兽入内”的警示牌！","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"不过警示牌上的有袋鼷兽其实都是乱画的，它们除了都长了个口袋，就没什么共同点了。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"咦，难道大部分雷姆必拓人没见过这种生物？","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-22$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$1","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"有袋鼷兽逃跑的速度非常快，只要它不愿意，就很少有人能看到它，如果你能看到它就说明它已经偷走了你的东西！","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#12$1","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"......不要这样看着我啦，安洁莉娜，这些都是奶奶告诉我的，奶奶从来不说假话的！","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_088","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"好啦，现在数据全在南境的数据采集器的存储器里，只能等远程通讯塔修好了。你就好好放松一下，泡个温泉怎么样？","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"那远程通讯塔什么时候能修好呢？","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_088","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"这就不知道了。线路这么长，又不知道出了什么问题，可能纵贯红土公司的人也很挠头吧。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#3$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"......","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"我可以去南境，把数据带回来呀！","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"all","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$1","focus":"all","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔&塔妮","text":"什么？！","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"l","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"不行！南境鲜有人涉足，因为通往南境的路实在太恶劣了！","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"零号公路你看到了吧？全是深坑和源石结晶，但只有沿着它才能到达南境。","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"之前罗德岛在南境设置采集装置的时候也频频受阻，光是抵达南境就花了好几个月。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"好几个月？我记得奶奶说她没走这么久啊？","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"l","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"大铁屯和南境中间有一片环境非常恶劣的区域，一年中没有几天是能正常通过的。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"首先，那片区域常年风沙大作，中间还会出现快速移动型沙暴，一般人进入沙暴范围后很快就会迷失方向，根本逃不出去。","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"其次，就算侥幸抓住了沙暴比较弱的时机，那边空气中的活性源石微粒浓度也非常高，去了和送死没什么区别！","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":368},{"type":"charslot","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"可罗德岛的人还是穿过去了，对吗？","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_088","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"按说正常想要抵达南境只能看天吃饭——找一个既没有沙暴，活性源石浓度也较低的日子......但这样的日子可太少了。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"罗德岛工程队能过去是因为——","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"无论罗德岛原先的工程队是如何抵达南境的，我都会用自己的方式到达那里。","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"我知道去南境非常困难，但犯了错就应该自己弥补，至少......让我试一试，好吗？","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_088","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"......看来我是拦不住你了？","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#6$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"嗯哼♪","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_088","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"皮塔","text":"不过我倒是好奇起来了，你到底为什么这么坚持？","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"尽量减少我犯错给大家带来的麻烦。这是我本来就应该做的。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"而且......这毕竟是我力所能及的事情啊。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":388},{"type":"charslot","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"n","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#6$1","focus":"n","id":391},{"type":"text","text":"安洁莉娜的声音尽管坚定，却带着一丝惆怅，不过另外两个人显然没听出来。","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"尤其是塔妮，她看着安洁莉娜的眼神里全是憧憬。","id":393},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"charslot","id":395},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#14$2","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"就、就只是这么回事啦。","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":398},{"type":"dialog","id":399},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":400},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":401},{"type":"charslot","id":402},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_bg_76_g4_dailytown.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":404},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":405},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":406},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":407,"musicid":3},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","id":408},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","focus":"l","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"80,0","focus":"l","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"让我看看地图......","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#3$2","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"-30,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":413},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"-30,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":415},{"type":"delay","time":"1.6","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"大涌泉镇在这里，嗯，下一站先去这边的洋蓟村，我记得有信使提起过那边产的胡萝卜干很好吃，可以带一点在路上......","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":419},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","id":420},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#4$2","posfrom":"-30,0","posto":"120,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$1","posfrom":"-30,0","posto":"120,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1.3","id":423},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":424},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#5$2","focus":"l","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"去太阳谷的路线让我再想想......","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":427},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#5$2","posfrom":"120,0","posto":"50,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"2","id":428},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":429},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#6$1","posfrom":"120,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":430},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":431},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"那个......塔妮，谢谢你一路帮我找到办事处，不过已经快到吃晚饭的时候了，你......不回家吗？","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我先不回家！安洁，我想问你一个问题......","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"你能不能带我一起上路，去南境？","id":437,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#12$2","focus":"l","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"嗯？！","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"等等，这可不是说说就行......","id":441,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"是、是这样的！","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":444},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-50,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.6","id":445},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":446},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":447},{"type":"text","text":"塔妮急忙从自己随身的红色小包里掏出一根糖胡萝卜条，递给安洁莉娜。","id":448},{"type":"text","text":"安洁莉娜下意识地接了过去。","id":449},{"type":"dialog","id":450},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.6","id":451},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":452},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$1","focus":"r","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"今天是我的生日，今天一过我就满十八岁了，爸爸妈妈答应过，我成年以后就可以一个人出门远行了——像我的奶奶一样！","id":454,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"你的奶奶......？","id":456,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"嗯！奶奶是一个很厉害的人。","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#18$1","focus":"r","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"她的身上总是挂着一块怀表，她说只要用时针对着太阳，就能辨别出南方。","id":460,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"不仅如此，这块怀表还是她的施术单元，奶奶的源石技艺天赋很高，总能轻轻松松地解决问题。","id":461,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"在雷姆必拓四处旅行的时候，奶奶用怀表做了很多很多厉害的事情，甚至还在六十岁时到达了南境！","id":463,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"只可惜那块怀表在那趟旅行中丢了，之后她也回到了大涌泉镇，没有再踏上过旅途......","id":465,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"哇，她一个人去的南境？","id":467,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"是啊，奶奶是个探险家，不过用我们的话来说，她是一名资深探路者。","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"探路者？","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":472},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-50,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.6","id":473},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":474},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":475},{"type":"text","text":"塔妮在小包里翻了翻，又从里面掏出一块山楂糖，再次递给安洁莉娜。","id":476},{"type":"text","text":"安洁莉娜迟疑了一下，还是接了过去。","id":477},{"type":"dialog","id":478},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.6","id":479},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":480},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"在我们雷姆必拓，聚落经常因为人口太多，必须寻找新的落脚点。这个时候，探路者就会出发，走入荒野，寻找新的适合生活的地方。","id":482,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"奶奶当年从原来的聚落出发，顺着外面的零号公路一路向北走，找到了这里。","id":483,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"在我小时候，奶奶一直和我讲她一路上的见闻。","id":485,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"峡谷中的太阳、飞来飞去却几乎没人见过的有袋鼷兽、比山还要高的移动舰船、比裂谷还深的矿场......","id":486,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我一直很想去看看奶奶说的那些事。","id":487,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$1","focus":"r","id":488},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"所以我一直在为这次远行做准备，每天都在这个小包里放一点路上会用到的东西，晚上回去再放到大背包里。","id":489,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"现在我的大背包已经准备得非常完善，可以支持我随时出发——等跟家人过完生日，明天我就跟你一起去南境！","id":490,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":491},{"type":"charslot","id":492},{"type":"text","text":"太阳渐渐落下。","id":493},{"type":"text","text":"见安洁莉娜已经吃完了那颗山楂糖，塔妮又在小包里开始翻找，随后高兴地向安洁莉娜递来一块香甜樱桃糕。","id":494},{"type":"text","text":"这次安洁莉娜克制住了接过来的冲动，不过面对塔妮热情的攻势，这点象征性的抵抗显然没什么用。","id":495},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":496},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":497},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"多谢你的零食。塔妮，我想我得......","id":498,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"嘿嘿，得找个地方落脚，还有好好吃点东西对不对？光是零食可填不饱肚子！","id":500,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$1","focus":"r","id":501},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我从来没有出过大涌泉镇，想听你讲讲外面的故事，要不来我家吃生日宴吧？","id":502,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#3$2","focus":"l","id":503},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"这个......","id":504,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":505},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hungry","id":506},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":507},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#14$2","focus":"l","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"呃......","id":509,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#18$1","focus":"r","id":510},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"嘿嘿~","id":511,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":512},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":513},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":514},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":515},{"type":"charslot","id":516},{"type":"background","id":517},{"type":"image","id":518}],"characters":["奇怪的年轻人A","安洁莉娜","奇怪的年轻人B","？？？","塔妮","不再奇怪的年轻人们","皮塔","皮塔&塔妮"]}